Yeah, but my first suggestion is much easier to do.

In weapon.c in weapon_hit_bonus(weapon) right after this line:

if (P_SKILL(wep_type) < skill) skill = P_SKILL(wep_type);

add

if (P_SKILL(weapon_type(uswapwep)) < skill) skill = 
P_SKILL(weapon_type(uswapwep));

And in weapon_dam_bonus(weapon)

Replace this line

if (P_SKILL(wep_type) < skill) skill = P_SKILL(wep_type);

with

	if (P_SKILL(weapon_type(uwep)) < skill) skill = P_SKILL(weapon_type(uwep));
	if (P_SKILL(weapon_type(uswapwep)) < skill) skill = 
P_SKILL(weapon_type(uswapwep));

This will keep low level unlucky characters from twoweaponing an 
unskilled secondary weapon and high level characters will at least be 
miffed at losing a few points of damage.

